draw(Circle(O,1));

label("$O$",O,NW);

label("$P$",P,SE);

//label("$A$",A,SE);

label("$D$",D,N);

[/asy]

Triangle $POD$ is a 45-45-90 triangle, so $DO = DP = \frac{\sqrt{2}}{2}$.  Therefore, the coordinates of $P$ are $\left(\frac{\sqrt{2}}{2}, -\frac{\sqrt{2}}{2}\right)$, so $\sin 315^\circ = \boxed{-\frac{\sqrt{2}}{2}}$.

